url: "https://evidencepress.org/releases/hidden-architecture-exact-signal/"
abstract: "Unrefereed research candidate. For a binary alternating-renewal signal known exactly, the smallest hidden Markov model that reproduces it can overstate the least possible dissipation: the exact three-state entropy minimum is (1-q)log(1/q), and for every 0<q<1 an explicit four-state model reproduces the same complete observed law with strictly less entropy production. A sharp lower bound from the entrance intensity, mean dwell and initial dwell density holds for hidden networks of any size; at q=1/20 it is about 108 times the earlier certified floor. Exact rational four- and five-state certificates at q=1/20."
